{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And you shall eat it in haste.</b> The Sages enacted that it be eaten when satiated, and the reason is explained in the Yerushalmi: because it is written ״ועצם לא תשברו בו״, and when a person is hungry he is prone to break the bone. And in the chapter כיצד צולין it is concluded that the prohibition of breaking a bone applies only at the time of eating the pesach."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:08.564697329Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}